SQL Analytics for Chaotic Semantic Memory

Usage: csm-analytics <COMMAND>

Commands:
  inspect  Open a SQL REPL-like prompt
  query    Run a one-shot SQL query and print the result
  stats    Show summary statistics for concepts and benchmarks
  export   Export data as a Parquet bundle
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
